      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "FLUX.3 Klein expects a full scene caption: framing, subject, background and light. Short prompts give generic images. Zero dimensions use 1024 x 1024, or the size of the first reference image. Connect up to 10 IMAGE references for editing. Install the pinned flux3 package into the model environment and select its python_executable in the loader. keep_loaded keeps the model in its worker for the next run; profile int8-attention is faster and changes the image slightly. See the node README."
      ]
